# public/ is generated by the predev / prebuild hooks, with one committed
# exception. Brand assets are copied in from the repo-root brand-assets/
# (../brand-assets/copy-brand-assets.mjs), and public/remote/ is mirrored from
# the URLs in remote-assets.json by scripts/fetch-remote-assets.mjs — images
# we don't hold a copy of, like the team headshots. Ignoring the directory's
# entries keeps that invariant self-maintaining: a new brand asset needs no
# edit here, and a file dropped into public/ by hand is caught. The exception
# is public/screens/, our own screen captures, which are committed because
# nothing external hosts them — hence the entry glob plus a carve-out rather
# than ignoring public/ whole.
/public/*
!/public/screens/
